{
 "_provenance": "Recorded 2026-10-18 on a throwaway, unclaimed Plex Media Server 1.42.2.10156-f737b826c (plexinc/pms-docker) on zen, over loopback with its .LocalAdminToken. Item 1 is a generated 20 s 3840x2160 HEVC Main 10 + FLAC 2.0 mkv, the codecs of rex#5's item without its Dolby Vision. `decisions` are GET /video/:/transcode/universal/decision answers to Plex for iOS 2026.20.0's request shape from rex#5 (directPlay=0, directStream=0, protocol=hls, 1080p 8 Mbps, X-Plex-Client-Profile-Name=Generic). X-Plex-Client-Profile-Extra is the app's own, copied from a Plex for iOS decision in rex-fun's log (the shape sent 16 times there, for an eac3 item). Controls: Generic without the extra, and the iOS profile. (The same target declared for dash, with the app's hls limitations left in, crashes this PMS, so it is not recorded.) The last row is Plex for Android (Mobile) 2026.19.1's own conversion request, copied from rex-fun's log on 2026-10-18 when a Pixel 6 picked 720p HD (2 Mbps): every query pair as sent, its path pointed at item 1, the token dropped and the device identifiers replaced.",
